Shikigami "Dance"
    Simple Domain: For Each move In
        Using: (x) -> dancemoves
        Apply
            Consider swap As (xs, a, b) -> set(set(xs, a, item(xs, b)), b, item(xs, a))
            Using: (x, move, i) ->
                consider arg as slice(move, 1, length(move))
                in if startswith(move, "s") then
                    consider k as length(x) - toint(arg)
                    in concat(drop(x, k), take(x, k))
                else if startswith(move, "x") then
                    consider ab as split(arg, "/")
                    in swap(x, toint(item(ab, 0)), toint(item(ab, 1)))
                else
                    consider ab as split(arg, "/")
                    in swap(x, indexof(x, item(ab, 0)), indexof(x, item(ab, 1)))

i16
Split ","
Cursed Object: dancemoves Of Itself
Apply
    Using: (x) -> "abcdefghijklmnop"
Split ""
Part "1":
    Dance
    Join
    stdout
Part "2":
    Cursed Object: cycle of Find Cycle
        Key: (x) -> textjoin(x, "")
        Dance
    Simple Domain: Repeat
        Times: (x) -> 1000000000 % item(cycle, 1)
        Dance
    Join
    stdout